@startuml
title Failure Triage Sequence
actor Owner
participant Runner
participant "Failed stage" as Stage
participant "Redacted evidence" as Evidence
participant "Correction workflow" as Fix
Owner -> Runner : Start validation
Runner -> Stage : Execute
Stage --> Runner : Non-zero result
Runner -> Evidence : Store and redact log
Runner --> Owner : Failed report
Owner -> Fix : Record finding and root cause
Fix -> Stage : Apply correction and focused test
Owner -> Runner : Rerun full gate
@enduml
